@startuml
title JoinUp - Data Access Class Diagram (Repository)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "internal/repository" {
  class EventRepo <<Repository>> {
    - ctx : context.Context
    - pool : pgxpool.Pool
    --
    + GetEventsByCreator(creator string) : []*models.Event
    + CreateEvent(event *models.Event) : error
  }
}

package "internal/models" {
  class Event <<Model>> {
    + Name : string
    + Desc : string
    + CreateTime : time.Time
    + Creator : string
    + Members : []string
    + Location : Location
  }

  class Location <<Model>> {
    + Name : string
    + Longitude : float64
    + Latitude : float64
  }
}

class "pgxpool.Pool" as PgxPool <<External>>

EventRepo --> PgxPool : uses
EventRepo ..> Event : returns/accepts
Event *-- Location : contains

note right of EventRepo
  Data access component.
  Works with Event model and DB pool.
end note

@enduml
